Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.18,0:01:25.04,FG_IntroBox,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1507,933)\fad(0,1300)}Portami a casa
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.18,0:01:25.04,FG_IntroBox,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1507,998)\fad(0,1300)}Ti scaldo il letto
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:25.04,Title 1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(362,688)\fad(1200,1300)}Miao!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.32,0:01:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ti chiamerò...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.22,0:01:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hai già deciso?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Io sono "Piccola Bianca", lui "Piccolo Nero".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Carino, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.96,0:01:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Non ti sei sprecata molto...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,E tu non ti sei sprecata con il mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pensandoci bene...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Luo Xiaohei è un nome fantastico!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Si è svegliato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.63,0:01:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ciao!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,L'hai spaventato!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.43,0:01:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Non avere paura.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.94,0:01:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Vieni qui!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.67,0:02:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Scusa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamma! Dov'è il piatto?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Non lo so. Non l'ho preso io...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.41,0:02:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Xiaohei deve averlo tirato lì dietro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Che strano. Diamo un'occhiata?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Spero non sia successo niente...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sta uscendo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Così presto?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Chissà perché ora è così tranquillo...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Prima l'hai spaventato tu, eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha la lingua blu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma i gatti hanno la lingua blu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,E che ne so io?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Finito!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.10,0:02:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Domani dovrò comprare la sabbietta e una lettiera.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A che servono?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarà il bagno del gatto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Non può usare il nostro?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.63,0:02:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Trovami un gatto che usa il bagno degli umani.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.92,0:02:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Beh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sono sicura che non sei un gatto qualunque.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Da dove vieni?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.12,0:03:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sei così bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Il tuo padrone doveva volerti tanto bene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Di sicuro è stato costretto ad abbandonarti.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.14,0:03:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,D'ora in poi sarò io la tua padroncina.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mi chiamo Luo Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Piacere di conoscerti, Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Io sono...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Un principe colpito da una maledizione.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.87,0:03:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Grazie per averla spezzata.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.83,0:03:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Con un bacio?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.92,0:03:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sì.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Che cliché...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Vorresti venire al mio castello stasera?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Devo ringraziarti come si deve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Non posso.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Domani ho la scuola.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.65,0:03:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Allora nel fine settimana.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.91,0:03:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Va bene...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.01,0:03:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting! La Perla Celeste è stata rubata.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.70,0:04:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Riconosci la tua colpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.07,0:04:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sì, Maestro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Recupererò la Perla Celeste.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Non sarà un'impresa facile,\Nvasto com'è il mare dei viventi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.15,0:04:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ho ferito il ladro costringendolo alla sua forma originale.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.01,0:04:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Non dovrebbe essere andato lontano.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.45,0:04:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Molto bene. Non tornare senza la Perla.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Agli ordini.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.97,0:05:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo micio! Vieni qui!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:05:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Farai tardi! Sbrigati!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:06:01.19,Title 2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(414,649)\fad(1200,0)}Scappa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrivo!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.92,0:06:10.50,FG_Dad,,0,0,0,,{\pos(725,564)\frz40}Io
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.92,0:06:10.50,FG_Dad,,0,0,0,,{\pos(803,550)\frz5\frx-20\fry-40}Sono
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.92,0:06:10.50,FG_Dad,,0,0,0,,{\pos(748,629)\frz15\frx-20\fry-40}il
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.92,0:06:10.50,FG_Dad,,0,0,0,,{\pos(815,629)\frz-5\frx-20\fry-50}Papà
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:10.50,BG_Dad_S1,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 675 550 l 737 515 765 575 715 599{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:10.50,BG_Dad_S1,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 754 425 l 840 441 840 499 779 490{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:10.50,BG_Dad_S1,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 714 450 l 770 421 783 500 736 505{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:10.50,BG_Dad_S1,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 790 338 l 840 350 845 420 790 415{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamma, Xiaohei ti sta mangiando la colazione.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.86,0:06:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A quanto pare non mangia il cibo per gatti.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Meno male che non l'ho ancora comprato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Possiamo dargli quello che mangiamo noi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tu non dovresti andare?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.35,0:06:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Devo andare a scuola!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.29,0:06:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Aspettatemi, per favore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Grazie...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.64,0:07:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Un gatto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sono a casa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cosa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei ha cercato di scappare?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Già, in qualche modo ha aperto la porta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,L'ho preso e l'ho riportato dentro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dovresti decidere se lasciarlo andare o meno.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Va bene...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.82,0:09:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, dove sei?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.03,0:09:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dove sei finito?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Te ne vuoi andare?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lo so, qui è pieno di macchine e di cani...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Se vuoi davvero andartene,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,questo fine settimana ti porterò in campagna.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Va bene?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.92,0:09:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Che ci fai lassù? Scendi subito!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Subito!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.35,0:10:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pronto? Ciao, Shanxin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sì, certo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:41.35,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1242,680)\fad(1200,0)}Ehi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.31,0:10:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Vuoi vedere Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.09,0:10:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, quando passi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sei alla porta?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.18,0:10:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehilà.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ciao!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Quanto tempo, Huangshou!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.05,0:10:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Questo è per Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.35,0:10:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Grazie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gli piacerà sicuramente.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ciao, Shanxin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.37,0:10:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Salve, signora Luo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Io devo fare pulizie, andate pure a divertirvi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Va bene.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mi ero scordata che ha sempre quell'aspetto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehi, come va?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai a salutarlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Che c'è, Huang?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sembra abbia paura di Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I gatti tendono a essere timidi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.82,0:11:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Non gli interessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.69,0:11:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Guarda e impara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.54,0:11:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Capito?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Prendilo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,L'ha preso!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Un'altra volta!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.87,0:11:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, sei bravissimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Macché.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Il punto è fare di tutto perchè non lo prenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Visto?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.47,0:11:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Dai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma mi sta prendendo in giro?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:12:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ragazze! Io vado al lavoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Va bene!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Figurati se non trovavi un'altra scusa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Huangshou l'ho portato a conoscere Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,E così tocca a me badare a lui.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Dai, ti prego!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.39,0:12:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Da che parte stai stavolta?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.47,0:12:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Per l'Orda!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Finalmente sveglio, pigrone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.04,0:12:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, che è successo alla tua coda?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.89,0:12:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,E quelli cosa sono?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,La tua coda!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Allora la coda dei gatti può dividersi in micetti!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.29,0:12:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hei-xiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,"Heixiu"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.34,0:12:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Heixiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:12:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ho capito, ti chiami Heixiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.55,0:13:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huangshou!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.72,0:13:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huangshou!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Scendi, Huangshou!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fai il bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Scendi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.83,0:13:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huangshou!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.23,0:13:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.93,0:13:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ti prego, riportalo qui!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pronto?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.76,0:14:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamma?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.15,0:14:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sì, sono da Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cosa? Stai venendo qui?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Niente, niente. A tra poco.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.35,0:14:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Salve, leggiadra donzella!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Le interessa una corazza di scaglie d'argento?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.91,0:14:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Corazza di scaglie d'argento!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.18,0:14:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Di prima scelta!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.37,0:14:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Solo 5 monete d'oro-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Che è successo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Non ne ho idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huangshou...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,È in calore...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Voi due non potete procreare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Da questo giorno in poi,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.29,0:15:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,sarò il tuo fedele servitore.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.33,0:16:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Devi solo firmare questo contratto, mia cara!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.58,0:15:58.62,FG_Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,1020)}Assicurazione
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:15:58.66,FG_Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,970)}Assicurazione
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:15:58.70,FG_Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,940)}Assicurazione
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:15:58.74,FG_Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,915)}Assicurazione
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:15:58.79,FG_Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,890)}Assicurazione
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:15:58.83,FG_Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,873)}Assicurazione
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:15:58.87,FG_Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,860)}Assicurazione
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:15:58.92,FG_Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,845)}Assicurazione
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:00.71,FG_Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,837)}Assicurazione
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Chi era?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Una comparsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.73,0:16:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hai preparato i bagagli? Non scordarti niente!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Lo so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.77,0:16:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Li hai chiamati?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sì.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Chi ha risposto?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Il cugino Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Le cose di scuola?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tutto pronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.23,0:16:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hai abbastanza calzini?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Metterò i sandali.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Lo spazzolino?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Me lo sono dimenticato!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.09,0:16:30.49,Title 4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1401,712)\fad(1200,0)}Vola!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:13.40,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,È mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:18.41,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Correte, stanno per azzuffarsi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.64,0:18:39.04,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Non piangere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.94,0:18:41.97,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Puoi giocarci tu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.94,0:19:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.75,0:19:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.19,0:19:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Forse è sul tetto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hai ragione! Vado a vedere!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma non arrampicarti!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:28.70,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Heixiu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Non lo trovo da nessuna parte...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.67,0:19:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Non preoccuparti, starà giocando a nascondino.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.11,0:19:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma se non lo rivedessimo più?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.83,0:19:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Vedrai che andrà tutto bene.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.15,0:19:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Dov'eri finito?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Ma quello non è il mio vestito?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come hai fatto a conciarlo così?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.73,0:19:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Micio cattivo!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.57,0:20:05.71,Guest,,0,0,0,,{\pos(580,350)\fs300}Uccellino
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.57,0:20:05.71,Guest,,0,0,0,,{\pos(255,370)\fs70}Ospite speciale
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:05.71,BG_Outro_Guest,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 950 500 0 500{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ti ho trovato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:32.71,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Resta con me, camminiamo calciando i sassolini lungo la via
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:32.71,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:37.45,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Anche se la nostra meta sarà di sicuro un po' capricciosa
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:37.45,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:42.15,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stringendo in entrambe le mani il profumo dei fiori
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:42.15,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.15,0:20:48.35,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Lo porterò fino a te, che devo ancora incontrare
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.15,0:20:48.35,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:54.50,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Aspettami, parliamo camminando spalla a spalla
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:54.50,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:59.30,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Anche se il nostro primo incontro sarà un po' impacciato
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:59.30,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:03.98,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Quando apriremo le scatole che abbiamo portato con noi
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:03.98,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.98,0:21:10.50,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Condividiamo i sogni che vi abbiamo racchiuso
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.98,0:21:10.50,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:21.82,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I giorni in cui possiamo dirci con naturalezza «a domani»
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:21.82,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:27.24,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Sono così preziosi e fin troppo fugaci
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:27.24,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:32.28,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Ma questi sentimenti di sicuro non svaniranno
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:32.28,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.28,0:21:43.51,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Non raggiungeremo le nuvole nel cielo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.28,0:21:43.51,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.51,0:21:49.06,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Ma si faranno pioggia per far sbocciare i fiori
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.51,0:21:49.06,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.06,0:21:55.90,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,E di certo, mi stanno chiamando
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.06,0:21:55.90,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
